{"case_id": "case_03_helios", "model_used": "lexical-tfidf-offline", "chunks": [{"chunk_id": "chk_doc_5d26236d_1", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_5d26236d", "document_name": "courier_shipping_manifest.txt", "document_type": "other", "speaker": null, "timestamp": "2024-08-16 14:30:00", "text": "CRYOEXPRESS COURIER SERVICES - WAYBILL #CX-889012 Sender: Helios Pharma Clinical Research Site 03 Pickup Timestamp: 2024-08-16 14:30:00 (Delayed from morning due to missing dry ice replenishment)", "sentence_indices": [0, 1, 2]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_5d26236d_2", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_5d26236d", "document_name": "courier_shipping_manifest.txt", "document_type": "other", "speaker": null, "timestamp": "2024-08-16 14:30:00", "text": "Package Temperature on Receipt: -12.0 C (Non-compliant with ultra-cold standard) Driver: Raymond Vance | Signee: Dr. Arlo Kaufman", "sentence_indices": [3, 4]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_4a071757_1", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_4a071757", "document_name": "freezer_iot_telemetry_log.txt", "document_type": "log", "speaker": null, "timestamp": null, "text": "HELIOS BIOMEDICAL - CRYOGENIC FREEZER TELEMETRY (UNIT 4) 2024-08-14 01:45:00 - Temp: -80.2 C - Status: NORMAL 2024-08-14 02:10:00 - POWER FAULT: Mains disconnected - Generator: OFFLINE", "sentence_indices": [0, 1, 2]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_4a071757_2", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_4a071757", "document_name": "freezer_iot_telemetry_log.txt", "document_type": "log", "speaker": "2024-08-14 04", "timestamp": null, "text": "2024-08-14 04:30:00 - Temp: -22.5 C - CRITICAL WARMING ALARM 2024-08-14 06:15:00 - Temp: +4.1 C - PRODUCT VIABILITY COMPROMISED 2024-08-14 07:45:00 - Mains power restored - Compressor active", "sentence_indices": [3, 4, 5]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_4a071757_3", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_4a071757", "document_name": "freezer_iot_telemetry_log.txt", "document_type": "log", "speaker": "2024-08-14 11", "timestamp": null, "text": "2024-08-14 11:00:00 - Temp: -78.9 C - Status: RECOVERED", "sentence_indices": [6]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_64d1a66b_1", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_64d1a66b", "document_name": "internal_memo_coverup.txt", "document_type": "email", "speaker": "Dr. Arlo Kaufman", "timestamp": "August 15, 2024", "text": "CONFIDENTIAL MEMORANDUM Date: August 15, 2024 From: Dr. Arlo Kaufman", "sentence_indices": [0, 1, 2]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_64d1a66b_2", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_64d1a66b", "document_name": "internal_memo_coverup.txt", "document_type": "email", "speaker": "Dr. Arlo Kaufman", "timestamp": "August 15, 2024", "text": "To: Clinical Supply Operations Subject: Batch HL-902B clearance I have personally re-verified the cold chain records.", "sentence_indices": [3, 4, 5]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_64d1a66b_3", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_64d1a66b", "document_name": "internal_memo_coverup.txt", "document_type": "email", "speaker": "Dr. Arlo Kaufman", "timestamp": "August 15, 2024", "text": "All vials in Freezer 4 remained within acceptable specifications. Proceed with patient administration for Friday morning cohort.", "sentence_indices": [6, 7]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_3bf26cac_1", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_3bf26cac", "document_name": "interview_dr_kaufman.txt", "document_type": "interview", "speaker": "INTERVIEW TRANSCRIPT", "timestamp": null, "text": "INTERVIEW TRANSCRIPT: DR. ARLO KAUFMAN Case: Helios Pharma Trial HL-902 Interviewer: Regulatory Auditor Sarah Jenkins", "sentence_indices": [0, 1, 2]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_3bf26cac_2", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_3bf26cac", "document_name": "interview_dr_kaufman.txt", "document_type": "interview", "speaker": "Dr. Arlo Kaufman", "timestamp": null, "text": "Interviewee: Dr. Arlo Kaufman, Principal Investigator [09:00 AM] JENKINS: Dr. Kaufman, were all Phase 2 sample vials kept at minus 80 Celsius continuously? [09:00 AM] KAUFMAN: Yes, absolutely. Freezer Unit 4 maintained strict minus 80 Celsius throughout the August testing window.", "sentence_indices": [3, 4, 5]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_3bf26cac_3", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_3bf26cac", "document_name": "interview_dr_kaufman.txt", "document_type": "interview", "speaker": "Dr. Arlo Kaufman", "timestamp": null, "text": "[09:01 AM] JENKINS: Did any power outage affect the cold storage? [09:01 AM] KAUFMAN: There was zero temperature excursion. The backup diesel generator kicked in seamlessly during the August 14 storm. [09:02 AM] JENKINS: When were the efficacy blood draws sent to the central reference lab?", "sentence_indices": [6, 7, 8]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_3bf26cac_4", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_3bf26cac", "document_name": "interview_dr_kaufman.txt", "document_type": "interview", "speaker": "Dr. Arlo Kaufman", "timestamp": null, "text": "[09:02 AM] KAUFMAN: They were dispatched via CryoExpress courier on August 16 at 08:00 AM under dry ice.", "sentence_indices": [9]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_26a05e75_1", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_26a05e75", "document_name": "interview_lab_tech_priya.txt", "document_type": "interview", "speaker": "INTERVIEW TRANSCRIPT", "timestamp": null, "text": "INTERVIEW TRANSCRIPT: PRIYA SHARMA Case: Helios Pharma Trial HL-902 Interviewer: Regulatory Auditor Sarah Jenkins", "sentence_indices": [0, 1, 2]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_26a05e75_2", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_26a05e75", "document_name": "interview_lab_tech_priya.txt", "document_type": "interview", "speaker": "Priya Sharma", "timestamp": null, "text": "Interviewee: Priya Sharma, Senior Laboratory Technician [10:30 AM] JENKINS: Priya, tell us about the condition of Freezer Unit 4 on August 14. [10:30 AM] SHARMA: The backup generator failed to engage for nearly six hours. The digital display on Freezer Unit 4 rose to plus 4 Celsius between 2:00 AM and 7:45 AM.", "sentence_indices": [3, 4, 5]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_26a05e75_3", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_26a05e75", "document_name": "interview_lab_tech_priya.txt", "document_type": "interview", "speaker": "Priya Sharma", "timestamp": null, "text": "[10:31 AM] JENKINS: Did you report this excursion to Dr. Kaufman? [10:31 AM] SHARMA: Yes, I sent an urgent email at 08:15 AM on August 14 and logged it in the paper deviation binder. [10:32 AM] JENKINS: What did Dr. Kaufman instruct you to do?", "sentence_indices": [6, 7, 8]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_26a05e75_4", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_26a05e75", "document_name": "interview_lab_tech_priya.txt", "document_type": "interview", "speaker": "Priya Sharma", "timestamp": null, "text": "[10:32 AM] SHARMA: He told me to discard the paper binder page and proceed with patient dosing as scheduled.", "sentence_indices": [9]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_c2f1942e_1", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_c2f1942e", "document_name": "patient_safety_adverse_event_report.txt", "document_type": "report", "speaker": null, "timestamp": "August 22, 2024", "text": "CLINICAL SAFETY BOARD - EXPEDITED AE SUMMARY Trial: HL-902-ONC | Drug: Velocept-4 Date: August 22, 2024", "sentence_indices": [0, 1, 2]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_c2f1942e_2", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_c2f1942e", "document_name": "patient_safety_adverse_event_report.txt", "document_type": "report", "speaker": null, "timestamp": "August 22, 2024", "text": "Findings: Five patients enrolled in Cohort 3 developed severe injection-site necrosis and acute fever within 12 hours of receiving doses from Batch HL-902B. Analysis: Chemical degradation of hydrolyzed adjuvant occurred due to thermal excursion.", "sentence_indices": [3, 4]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_4e6ee528_1", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_4e6ee528", "document_name": "sponsor_audit_findings.txt", "document_type": "log", "speaker": null, "timestamp": null, "text": "GLOBAL HEALTH REGULATORY AUDIT Helios Pharma Site 03 Inspection Report Lead Inspector: Sarah Jenkins", "sentence_indices": [0, 1, 2]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_4e6ee528_2", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_4e6ee528", "document_name": "sponsor_audit_findings.txt", "document_type": "log", "speaker": null, "timestamp": null, "text": "Violations Noted: 1. Major protocol non-compliance: Failure to report 5.5-hour cryogenic failure on August 14.", "sentence_indices": [3, 4, 5]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_4e6ee528_3", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_4e6ee528", "document_name": "sponsor_audit_findings.txt", "document_type": "log", "speaker": null, "timestamp": null, "text": "2. Intentional falsification of trial records by Principal Investigator Dr. Arlo Kaufman. 3.", "sentence_indices": [6, 7, 8]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_4e6ee528_4", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_4e6ee528", "document_name": "sponsor_audit_findings.txt", "document_type": "log", "speaker": null, "timestamp": null, "text": "Administering degraded clinical trial material to human research subjects.", "sentence_indices": [9]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_9cd957d0_1", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_9cd957d0", "document_name": "urgent_tech_email.txt", "document_type": "email", "speaker": "Priya Sharma", "timestamp": "August 14, 2024 08:15 AM", "text": "From: Priya Sharma <p.sharma@heliospharma.org> To: Arlo Kaufman <a.kaufman@heliospharma.org> Date: August 14, 2024 08:15 AM", "sentence_indices": [0, 1, 2]}, {"chunk_id": "chk_doc_9cd957d0_2", "case_id": "case_03_helios", "document_id": "doc_9cd957d0", "document_name": "urgent_tech_email.txt", "document_type": "email", "speaker": "Priya Sharma", "timestamp": "August 14, 2024 08:15 AM", "text": "Subject: CRITICAL: Unit 4 Thawing overnight - Batch HL-902B Dr. Kaufman, Freezer Unit 4 lost power at 2:10 AM and warmed up to +4.1 C.", "sentence_indices": [3, 4, 5]}, {"chu